Alright, here's what happened.  I fully explored the Astral Plane, I
found my altar and everything, but one of the player monsters on the
level was Izchak the invisible adventurer, so I wanted to take him with
me to heaven.  I was thinking I could polymorph him into something I
could tame and then take him.  But the RNG had other plans.  I was well
stocked up on healing potions and everything, but I died to Pestilence.
 How, you may ask?  The fricking thing didn't show up on my status
line!  The default 80 columns wide just ain't large enough anymore.  So
I didn't even know I was sick until it was too late.  I'll have to play
in a larger window from now on.  But to have a promising character die
from such an annoying death is aggravating, though I suppose I've
gotten used to it.  My conducts were genoless, polyselfless (that one
you see on the list was an accident), and wishartifactless.

So anyway, I've now completed barbarian, priest, valkyrie, wizard, and
samurai.  What shall I do next?

